      "tactic_notes": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Petra(19)</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Lumberjack】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">A Youngster from the village, she and her brother Pavel are the child of a famous woodworker \"Petro\" Though ever since the Lumina Revolution, the empire has find little need for wood, so their father moved to Lesminir where people appreciate his vintage works more.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Character Notes】</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Lesnimir Youth</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Mikhail, Vila, Pavel and Petra are all childhood friend and youths who grew up alongside each other in Lesnimir. They enjoy playing and the company of each other.</p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Strict Older Sister</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">She cares about her brother Pavel a lot, but often express concern over his decision to shut himself in the village due to fears of Vila revenge for the incident, despite Petra loves of berating her brother for his laziness, she still picks up her brother work in his stead.</p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Responsibility</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Her father Petro, died when she and her brother are very young, after their father death, she took the responsibility of her father upon herself to take care of her younger brother too.</p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Hard Choices</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">She symphatize with Mikhail situation but agrees that Vila must not be allow to stay in the village due to Witches being wanted by the Empire millitant. Part of this comes from her concern about her brother's safety as well.</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Favourite Food】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Stuffed Cabbage Rolls (Golubtsi):</strong> These classic rolls consist of cabbage leaves filled with a savory mixture of ground meat, rice, and herbs, simmered in a flavorful tomato-based sauce.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>【View on Magic】</strong></p>\n<p>As one of the Youth of Lesnimir, Petra is more skeptical about the Empire's propaganda, but acknowledge the danger that Vila poses if she were to stay in the village</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Sample Dialog】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬\"Oh, hello, I'm Petra, a woodworker, it's nice to meet you\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬 \"Ever since the Lumina Revolution, there's not so much used for woodworking, huh? it's only in a rural town like this where people still enjoy our vintage service\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬 \"With Lumina efficiency for heating, who'll ever need wood again? hah. Guess it's just the age of Metal and Lumina now.\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬 \"OH for the love of-! Pavel, honestly, sometimes I think you'd mistake a squirrel rustling in the trees for a ghost! You've got to stop scaring yourself.\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬 \"Someone's got to take care of the woodwork while you're off imagining witches, Pavel. Lucky for you, that someone's me!\"</p>",
